-- [[kaggriculture-teacher-distills-per-slot-kl-and-per-seat-winner-ce|Kaggriculture teacher distills per-slot KL and per-seat winner CE]]: Phases 4.1–4.3 on CPU. The grammar core gives replay-conditioned per-slot masked logits and a liveness-weighted KL(teacher ‖ student), cached as `KaggricultureTeacherTargets` (102,208 B per seat row) with a grammar signature. The cached path is bit-for-bit the combined path. The model owns a live-seat-mean winner CE, PPO dispatches teacher calls statelessly and logs `teacher/cache_bytes`. Eleven killed mutations. Phase 4 is not complete: the trainer and run_ppo launch/resume tests are written but skipped (the launch/resume pair dry-run with config validation bypassed). After the integration merge an unskipped probe still fails all four on the missing trainer observation mapping and run_ppo's no-env stop (configs and value-mode guards have landed), and 4.4 is not done though its configs prerequisite has merged. A GPU component bundle at `8fde43c` (synthetic, fresh weights, BF16, compiled trunk) found near-zero self KL, bit-identical cached and combined paths and a finite teacher-term backward; cross-chunk/minibatch equality, multi-rank and trainer integration stay open.
